              "name": "message",
              "value": "=Hi {{ $json.full_name.split(' ')[0] }},  This is the Access Consulting Team here. Thank you for filling out the form.  Your profile puts you in an elite tier. You are an ideal candidate for Germany's top-ranked public universities and competitive scholarships.  Our team - mostly LUMS alumni now living and working in Germany - has walked this exact path; please review who we are at: https://theaccessconsulting.com/about/  Your CGPA sits above the 3.7 mark. We encourage you to take the Scholarship route as well as the public universities track in parallel. This means that our Scholarship Lead, Mir Sanaullah, who himself graduated on a Fulbright Scholarship from Columbia University, will prepare and review your documents.  You can check our student testimonials for proven results here: https://theaccessconsulting.com/proven-results/. We would be happy to answer any questions you may have regarding this.  Let's get your application moving!  ~The Access Consulting Team",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
