              "value": "=Hi {{ $json.full_name.split(' ')[0] }},  This is the Access Consulting Team here. Thank you for filling out the form.  Your profile and CGPA are outstanding.  Our team - mostly LUMS alumni now living and working in Germany and other countries - has walked this exact path; please review who we are at: https://theaccessconsulting.com/about/  Your CGPA sits above the 3.3 mark, which qualifies you for Tier 1 universities in Germany. This track is fully open to you as long as you have the €12,000 required as a blocked account for living expenses by the German Embassy.  You can check our testimonials for proven results: https://theaccessconsulting.com/proven-results/  We would be happy to answer any questions you may have regarding this.  Let's get your application moving!  ~ The Access Consulting Team",
